{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your best friend really came through, showing up one day with two slaves, Riley and Ashley, and even handing over their own slave, Giselle, as a gift. Now you\u2019re living in an apartment with them, and life is way more interesting. They\u2019re always around, keeping things fun and giving you a solid crew to roll with wherever you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At work, they tag along, making the day less boring and even helping out with stuff. When you\u2019re out with your friends, they\u2019re part of the group, and they definitely help you stand out a little more. Whether it\u2019s just hanging out or trying to impress someone new, they always make things more fun and way easier for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Back at the apartment, it\u2019s all about kicking back and doing whatever feels right. With Riley, Ashley, and Giselle around, there\u2019s always something going on, and life\u2019s never dull. Whether you\u2019re out and about or just hanging at home, they\u2019re there to keep the good times rolling.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Birthday Surprise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3103370/f7a0e64ce0e350a9c564b1ab8ff2f6d8309e9c92.jpg"},{"name":"Nude Party","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3103370/d825c9beaa572c8d7666e753c4b218a8fd4217d7.jpg"},{"name":"Better Angle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3103370/eb014ccc265d9949896576eb5c8f8877368c4016.jpg"},{"name":"Slaves Sleep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3103370/4fc4827feabc0bc5e8b6d3c6036cda1b15d85ef3.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3103370?t=1742918768","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3103370?t=1742918768","capsule_image":"https://shared